---
Advayavivaraṇaprajñopāyaviniścayasiddhi of Padmavajra
	% Ga = NAK l.s. 3-366 , page 18
	% Gha = CIHTS lib. no. 21548, ff. 6-17
---

[p. 211] idānīṃ prajñeti , upāya iti bhāgadvayaṃ vicāryate | prajñā kimucyate ? dharmato pravicala(ya)lakṣaṇā śrutacintā bhāvanāmayī | dvividhā prajñāpratyavekṣaṇā , nairvedhikī ceti | prati prati pratyavekṣate anviṣyate jñāyate cakṣurvajreṇa gṛhyate sā pratyavekṣaṇā prajñā | nairvedhikī nirviddhyate 'nayā pratyavekṣaṇā sā nairvedhikī prajñā | sā nairvedhikī uttaratra spaṣṭamasya sannairātmā sarvasattvajīvādikameva buddhyā niḥsukhaṃ jñānaṃ karoti , sākṣāt pratipattiṃ karoti , sudurjayaśca bhavati , ajayo bhavatīti yāvat |
upāyo 'pi caturvidho bodhivajreṇa varṇitaḥ | buddhavajreṇa varṇita iti yāvat |

sevāvidhānaṃ prathamaṃ dvitīyamupasādhanam |
sādhanaṃ tṛtīyaṃ caiva mahāsādhanaṃ caturthamiti || 1 || (gu. sa., pṛ. 162 )

aparaṃ cedam —

prathamaṃ śūnyatābodhiḥ dvitīyaṃ vajrasaṃhṛtiḥ |
tṛtīyaṃ bimbaniṣpattiścaturthaṃ cā(nyā)samakṣaram ||
ebhirvajracatuṣkeṇa jñānaniṣpattirucyate || 2 || (gu. sa., pṛ. 163)


[p. 212] ata eva abhāvalakṣaṇā prajñā , bhāvalakṣaṇa upāya iti | tathāṃ coktam — niḥsvabhāvalakṣaṇā prajñā , svabhāvalakṣaṇa upāyaśceti |

tasmāt prayoginastena (dharmeṇa ? ) saṃsāro 'nuvivardhate |
sukhāḥ kāmaguṇāḥ pañca bālānāṃ bo(bā)dhane matāḥ || 3 ||

yoginaste(gī tu te)na dharmeṇa buddhatvaṃ sādhayet punaḥ |
rā[go] harṣastathā prītirmaitrī ca karuṇā tathā || 4 ||

upekṣā muditā caiva balamutsāha eva ca |
sau(śau)ryaṃ vīryaṃ tathā raudraṃ haṭhatvaṃ sāhasaṃ tathā |
svarūpāḥ prakṛtīścānyā[ḥ] svādhiṣṭhānena saṃcaret || 5 ||

ekamudrāsamāyuktaścaturmudrāyuto 'thavā |
antaḥpuragato vāpi svādhiṣṭhānamanusmaret || 6 ||

rūpaṃ śabdaṃ tathā gandhaṃ rasaṃ sparśaṃ ca śobhanam |
anubhūyāt sadā yogī mahāsukhapade sthitaḥ || 7 ||

tataścai(taṃ cai)vāvanaddhaṃ ca ghaṭaṃ śuṣirameva ca |
vādyaṃ caturvidhaṃ yogī svādhiṣṭhānena nirviśet || 8 ||

śṛṅgārādīn rasān sarvān navanāṭya(ṭaka)saṃjñakān |
anubhūyāt sadā yogī māyopamasamādhinā || 9 ||

yogatantre samuddiṣṭā[ḥ] sthomā(stobhā)dyā ye ca vistarāḥ |
tāṃśca pravartayed yogī māyayā 'nupalambhataḥ || 10 ||

unmiṣannimiṣan vāpi hasan jalpaṃstathaiva ca |
gacchaṃstiṣṭhansvapan bhuñjan māyādehamanusmaret || 11 ||

[p. 213] jagatyanyāśca yāḥ krīḍā nānāsaṅkalpakalpitāḥ |
vicaret tāśca tattvajño mahārāganaye sthitaḥ || 12 ||

svādhiṣṭhānamidaṃ prāpya sarvadṛṣṭividāraṇam |
sarvaṃ kuryānna kuryād vā yathārucitaceṣṭitaḥ || 13 ||

caityakarma na kurvīta na ca pustakavācanam |
karotu vācayeccāpi svādhiṣṭhānakrameṇa tu || 14 ||

devān na vandayedevaṃ bhikṣūṃścāpi na vandayet |
athavā vandayet sarvān svādhiṣṭhānakrameṇa tu || 15 ||

mantranyāsaṃ na kurvīta mudrābandhaṃ tathaiva ca |
mantrajāpaṃ na kuryād vā kuryācca pratibimbavat || 16 ||

madīya(yaṃ) dṛśyate cittaṃ bāhyamarthaṃ na vidyate |
evaṃ vai bhāvayet māṣān(bhāvān) tathatāmapyanusmaret || 17 ||

anantadhyānavidhinā mantramūrtisamādhinā |
yadi māyā na labdha(bdhā) syāt sarvaṃ bhūmi(ri)phalāya vai || 18 ||

dehabhogapratiṣṭhā ca bhūmipāramitādayaḥ |
buddhaṛddhivikurvādi sarvaṃ māyāviceṣṭitam || 19 ||

ādarśabimba(mbe) sakalāṃ(laṃ) sa(su)yuktaṃ rūpaṃ yathā svacchataraṃ vibhāti |
aśītyanuvyañjanalakṣaṇādyo(ḍhyo) dehastathā vajradharaḥ sadaiva || 20 ||

indrāyudhaṃ viyati dṛṣṭamanekavarṇaṃ lokasya darśayati karma śubhāśubhāya |
karaṇavidhānena bheditāḥ |
tataḥ kurvanti sattvārthaṃ viśvarūpo maṇiryathā || iti |

[p. 214] tena tāvatprajñeti , upāya iti vyavasthitaṃ bhāgadvayam |
idānīṃ nirucyate – prajñayā kevalayā kiṃ buddhatvaṃ syāt ? no cedupāyamātreṇāpi ? ucyate cedam - na kevala prajñāmātreṇa buddhatvaṃ bhavati , nāpyupāyamātreṇa , kintu yadi punaḥ prajñopāyalakṣaṇau samatāsvabhāvau bhavataḥ , etau dvāvabhinnarūpau bhavataḥ , tadā bhuktirmukti[śca] bhavatīti |

tathā coktam -

upanayatyabhimataṃ yasmānnaukevānukūlaya(lya)taḥ |
tadānukūlayogena saivopāyaḥ prakīrtitaḥ ||

ubhayormīlanaṃ yacca salilakṣīrayoriva |
advayākārayogena prajñopāyaṃ taducyate ||

prakṣeptumapanetuṃ ca śakṣa(kya)te yatra naiva hi |
prakṣepāya ca yat tyaktaṃ dharmatattvaṃ taducyate ||

cintāmaṇirivāśeṣajagataḥ sarvadā sthitaḥ |
bhuktimuktipadaṃ samyak prajñopāyasvarūpataḥ ||

idameva samāgamya saṃbuddhāḥ sugatāḥ purā |
sambudhyante ca sarvatra sambhotsyante jagaddhitāḥ || iti |

yadi punariyaṃ prajñeti , idaṃ copāyamiti , yadyevaṃ bhāgadvayaṃ kriyate , tadā buddhatvaṃ na bhavet | yadi punaranayoḥ śūnyatāsvabhāvamekākārarūpatayā samyak prakarṣaparyantavartino vijñānamutpadyate , tadā niyataṃ yogināmihaiva janmani buddhatvaṃ vajradharatvaṃ ceti | na caivaṃ prajñopāyarahitaṃ jñānamutpadyate , [p. 215] prajñopāyātmakaṃ jñānamutpadyate | kiṃ bahunā , prajñopāya dvayaparijñānena yogināṃ muktiriti | tasmāt prajñopāyajanitātmakāḥ sarvatraidhātukādayaḥ sattvāḥ | ata eva buddho bhagavān mahākaruṇāpraṇidhānabalena yo yaḥ prapañcarūpeṇa dharmanairātmyayogena ca jñānajñeyavibhāgadvayena vyavasthitaḥ san ekākāraṃ jñānaṃ muktidharmamupadarśayati | ato 'rthamādiśuddhāḥ sarvadharmāḥ prakṛtiprabhāsvarāḥ śrutvā(tā) iti bhagavato(tā) buddhenedamuktam | tathā coktaṃ saṃvarākhye tantre -

eta eva hi sambuddhā ekahetusamudbhavāḥ |
pūrvakalpe punarjātā vāsanākleśahetutaḥ || iti |

tata(da)rtha ....... na satye(ne ?)kaputrapremātiśayatayā sarvasattvāḥ parigṛhītā iti | tathā coktam - " ko 'smākaṃ bhaṇati buddho bhagavānanuttarāṃ samyaksambodhimabhisambuddhaḥ " iti | yāvacca traidhātukasattvān buddhatve pratiṣṭhāpayāmastāvad buddha iti nāmadheyaṃ na lebhire | tathā coktaṃ bhadracaryāpraṇidhāne -

yāvata niṣṭha na tasya bhaveyyā sattva aśeṣata niṣṭha tathaiva |
karmatu kleśatu yāvata niṣṭhā tāvata niṣṭha mama praṇidhānam ||

tathā coktaṃ samādhirājatantre(sūtre) -

buddha bhaviṣyati sarvajano 'yaṃ nāsti ha kaścidabhājanasattvaḥ || iti |

ato 'rthaṃ sarvabhāvasvabhāvamūrtirbhagavān mahākaruṇāpraṇidhānabalena prajñopāyavibhāgadvayaṃ vyavasthitam | dharmasambhoganirmāṇarūpeṇa sākāranirākārarūpeṇa vyavasthitaḥ san bhavyasattvānāṃ prati vicitraprajñopāyanāṭakaṃ prakaṭayati | yena prajñopāyanāṭakaparijñānena ihaiva buddhatvaṃ vajradharatvaṃ ceti | [p. 216] atropadeśo melāpyate | prajñā kimucyate | prajñā padmaṃ vidhīyate | prajñāśabde śaṅkate | tena padmasvabhāvena locanā-māmakī-pāṇḍarā-tārā-samantabhadrā-pañcadevīśūnyatāsvabhāvā prajñā svabhāvenoktā iti | pṛthivyaptejovāyvākāśādayaḥ pañcabhūtā śūnyatārūpeṇa vyavasthitā iti yāvat | tena śūnyatāsvabhāvarūpeṇaiva locanā-māmakī-pāṇḍaravāsinī-tārā-samantabhadrāḥ pañcadevatyaḥ tatra pariṇatā iti | akṣobhya-ratnasambhava-amitābhāmoghasiddhiśrīmadvairocanādayo 'pi devatā dharmanairātmyayogena śrīrūpadharo(rā) bhūtvā locanādipañcadevīrūpeṇa pariṇatā iti | yā ca samantabhadrā devatī śūnyatārūpātmikā , sā prajñāpāramitā caturdevī jñānātmikā sphāraṇasaṃharaṇasvabhāvena vyavasthitā | śrīmahāvairocanākārajñānapariṇatasvabhāvā samantabhadrā prajñāpāramitāśabdenoktā iti | kiṃ bahunā , yā samantabhadrā prajñāpāramitā sā 'bhāvarūpā ākāśalakṣaṇatvena śūnyatākārā viviktā prakṛtiprabhāsvarā jñānajñeyarahitā niḥsvabhāvalakṣaṇā dharmakāyapariṇatā satī vaineyajanaṃ prati sambhogakāyena sā vyavasthitā satī nirmāṇādikaṃ pratibhāsate(sayati) | sambhogakāyaścāpi śūnyatālakṣaṇaṃ(ṇaḥ) | śūnyatā ca sarvākāravaropetatvena vyavasthitā | māyāmarīcisvapnapratibimbapratiśrutyo(tko)dakacandranirmitopamasvabhāvatayā pratipadyata iti | tathā coktam — " kāyaṃ sāmbhogikaṃ śūnyaṃ dharmakāyaṃ nairmāṇakaṃ kṛtvā bhāṣitaṃ sarvabuddhaiḥ " [iti] |


prajñopāyaśabdena kimucyate ? prajñayā upāyaḥ prajñopāya iti , prajñājanita upāya ityarthaḥ | upāya ityanena śabdena ko 'rtho bhaṇyate ? śrīvajrasattvaḥ saṃsārabhūtaḥ karuṇāsvabhāvaḥ sthiravastusvabhāvamūrtiḥ upāyaśabdenokta iti | upāyaḥ śrīvajrasattva iti | pañcakāyātmakaṃ pañcatathāgatātmakaṃ ca sphāraṇasaṃharaṇasvabhāvena vyavasthitamiti | vajrapadmasamāyogena [p. 217] prajñāliṅgita ekākārarūpeṇa jñānasvabhāvaṃ bhāvayediti | prajñopāya ityanayordvayoḥ kaḥ sambandhaḥ ? locanādipañcadevatyo bhūtādisvabhāvena śūnyatākārarūpeṇa pariṇatā iti | upāyo 'pi śrīvajrasattvaḥ sarvabhāvasvabhāvaḥ sthiracalasarvabhāvasvabhāvasya yā śūnyatā sā śūnyatākārayogena pariṇatā iti | oṃ hūṃ ityanenākṣaradvayena ekākāramiti | prajñopāyasthāpanārthaṃ dvidhārūpaṃ gataḥ | na ca vajrasattvo dvidhābhāvaṃ yāti | ta(ya)dā śūnyena śūnyatayā 'krāntaṃ bhavati , tadā ekākāraṃ pratibhāsata iti | anyacca prajñopāyātmakāḥ sarvasattvā iti ye prajñopāyasvabhāvadvaidhībhāvaṃ kurvanti tebhyo vidyāgrahagṛhītāḥ sambhoga(gaṃ) salīlamavalokya pārapatitāstiṣṭhanti | ye punaradvayākāraṃ viśuddhākāratayā tattvarūpaṃ paśyanti bhāvayanti ca , te 'nuttarabodhiphalalābhina iti | tena prajñopāyobhayasvabhāvatayā na kaścid buddhānāṃ bhagavatāṃ bandhanam | kaścit paṇḍitaḥ samatāyogena muktirbha(ko bha)vati | tathā coktam -

bajjhanti jeṇa jatā(ḍā) parimuṃcanti teṇa budhā |
bodhivibhāvanayā viparītamidaṃ sakalam ||

punaścoktam -

yena yena hi bhāvena tatra tatrābhyāsabalād viśiṣṭatarasvabhāvamāviṣkarotyapunardṛṣṭadharmatālakṣaṇam | tathā coktam —

yena yena hi bhāvena manaḥ saṃyujyate nṛṇām |
tena tanmayatāṃ yāti viśvarūpo maṇiryathā ||

punaścoktam -

yena yena hi badhyante jantavo raudrakarmaṇā |
sopāyena tu tenaiva mucyante bhavabandhanāt ||

[p. 218] tathā coktam -

kāmaśokabhayonmādacaurasvapnādyupaplutāḥ |
abhūtānapi paśyanti purato 'vasthitāniva ||

tasmād bhūtamabhūtaṃ vā yadyadeveti bhāvyate
bhāvanābalaniṣpattau tasya sākalyadhīḥ phalam ||

karuṇa uṇe viṇumuṇḍuhiṃ laggo | ṇau so pāvai uttima maggo ||
ahavā karuṇā kevali bhāvai | so saṃsāramokṣa na pāvai ||

yo puṇa vaṇṇi viyoga ṇa sakkai |
i nau bhava nau nivvāṇa hiṃ thākkai ||

ayamarthaḥ – karuṇa iti | karuṇārahito yadi śūnyatāyāṃ lagati , tadāsī yogī uttamamārgaṃ na labhate , buddhatvamārgaṃ na labhata iti yāvat | athavā śūnyatārahito yadi karuṇākevalī bhāvyate , tadā saṃsārasya muktirna labhyate | yaḥ punaryogī bhāvadvayaṃ jñātvā prajñopāyarāśidvayaṃ yojayituṃ śakyate , ekākāraṃ kartuṃ śakyate | na tadbhavaṃ na nirvāṇamiti bhavaṃ saṃsāraṃ nirvāṇaṃ buddhatvamiti |

ekārākṛti yad divyaṃ madhye vaṃkārabhūṣitam |
ālayaḥ sarvabuddhānāṃ buddharatnakaraṇḍakam ||

ekāraṃ padmamityuktaṃ vaṃkāraṃ vajramityāhuḥ |
tatra buddhāḥ samutpannāstatra vai parinirvṛtāḥ ||

ityadvayavivaraṇaprajñopāyaviniścayasiddhiḥ ||
kṛtiriyamācāryapadmavajrapādānām ||
